Experience for this position includes at least three of the following: Maintaining machine learning, natural language processing, and/or artificial intelligence systems in production;
Assisting in research and evaluation of the state-of-the-art topics in data science, such as deep learning and large language models;
Using data engineering techniques to process large, complex datasets into structured formats for record matching, anomaly detection, data analysis, and/or estimation;
Writing high-quality, maintainable code for analytics and applications using the Python programming language.
